<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I feel I’m unable to do what others can do.</l><l>As I look all around me, they all seem more useful to You.</l><l>But I see, dear Lord, I‘m here for Your need,</l><l>To build up Your church today!</l><l>And You gave these gifts that I may be trained,</l><l>Lord, perfect me, I pray!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In the church I’m perfected by the saints with the life supply.</l><l>I am growing and building, as I learn to minister Christ!</l><l>“Till we all arrive,” yes, this is our goal!</l><l>Every member builds today!</l><l>Lord, I give myself, Your Body to build.</l><l>Lord, for this now I pray!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
